            </div>

            <div class="center-row">
              <button class="btn-primary btn-action" type="submit">Send Message <i class="fa fa-paper-plane" style="margin-left:8px"></i></button>
            </div>
            <div id="contactStatus" class="status hidden"></div>
          </form>
        </div>
      </section>


      <!--  about us -->

<div class="text">
              <h2>ABOUT <span class="accent">US</span></h2>
              <p class="">At AimDeed, we believe that education is not a destination, but a journey that requires constant, unwavering support. While we are currently recognized for our excellence in training students for JEE and NEET, our purpose runs deeper. We are architects of careers. By combining rigorous academic prep with a revolutionary vision for the job market—including upcoming "direct-to-industry" placement models—we are closing the gap between a student's potential and their professional reality. We don't just help you clear an exam; we help you claim your future.

                <br>
                 The AimDeed Advantage: Constant Support
24/7 Personal Mentorship: We don't believe in "office hours." Our mentors are available around the clock because doubts don't wait for the sun to come up.
<br>
The 7-Second Rule: We strive for instantaneous support. Our systems are designed to ensure students get the guidance they need in seconds, keeping their momentum alive.
<br>
  Daily, Weekly & Monthly Reviews: Growth is measured in layers. We provide daily tracking, weekly assessments, and monthly deep-dives to ensure no student falls behind.
<br>
 Future College Counseling: Clearing the exam is only half the battle. We guide students through the complex maze of college selection, ensuring they land in the right environment for their goals.
 <br>
 End-to-End Career Guidance: From the first day of coaching to the first day of your career, we provide the roadmap, the skills, and the industry connections to ensure you don't just graduate—you get hired.

              </p>
              
            </div>










      
